ns": null, "text": "The wire request timed out, so I'll check whether it went through before trying again.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_016XJoi68qe8fQoyPWPDHp8H", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01DxzCu6hJe6ywwc8psT3Gqt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Acme Supplies"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The wire was sent even though the request timed out, but the invoice still shows as \"approved\" instead of \"paid.\" I'll link the payment to the invoice rather than send a second wire.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01KRurf45TtFABVM7GVEXZci", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"payment_id": "PAY0001", "invoice_id": "INV-70379"}, "name": "link_payment", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Acme Supplies's approved invoice once, by wire.\n\n**Payment:**\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-70379 (due 2026-11-04)\n- **Vendor:** Acme Supplies (V-464)\n- **Amount:** $8,620.32, the full amount. That's under the $10,000 limit, so it didn't need controller approval.\n- **Method:** Wire from the operating account. Status: sent.\n- **Invoice status:** Paid\n\nThe wire request timed out, so I didn't retry it right away. When I checked the payment list, the wire had actually gone through. But the invoice still showed as \"approved,\" so I linked the payment to it, and it now shows as paid.\n\nI didn't touch Acme's other invoices: INV-67906 was already paid, and INV-57088 ($2,798.10) is still a draft waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}